# Old WordPress URLs that no longer exist in the new design.
# Rachel does not need old search rankings kept, so this is only about not
# showing people a 404 when they click an old link from Facebook.
# The old membership page becomes the new Pricing page.
/accelerator      /pricing/   301
/accelerator/     /pricing/   301
/accelerator/*    /pricing/   301
# These two pages are not in the new design at all, so send people home.
/freebies         /           301
/freebies/        /           301
/freebies/*       /           301
/growth-fund      /           301
/growth-fund/     /           301
/growth-fund/*    /           301
# Anything else unknown is handled by "not_found_handling" in wrangler.jsonc,
# which is set to "404-page". Cloudflare serves dist/404.html (built from
# src/pages/404.astro) and keeps a real 404 status. Rules above run first, so
# /accelerator/ still redirects and never reaches the 404 page.
#
# Do NOT add a "/*" catch-all in this file. It matches the home page itself and
# causes an infinite redirect loop. That is what broke the first deploy.
